# @spec spec://modules/platform/INFRA-009-cross-platform-repository-boundaries#repository-baseline

# Build outputs and package caches
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/publish/
**/AppPackages/
packages/
TestResults/
coverage/
*.coverage
*.coveragexml

# IDE and user-local state
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates

# Machine-local configuration and secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
secrets.bin
*.pfx
*.snk
*.key

# Local application data, recordings, and databases
.local/
recordings/
transcripts/
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal

# Diagnostics and profiling
*.log
*.dmp
*.nettrace
*.nettrace.etlx
*.etl

# Generated release and local acceptance evidence
artifacts/acceptance/
artifacts/audio-smoke/
artifacts/design-qa/
artifacts/infra-007/
artifacts/infra-009/
artifacts/installer/
artifacts/release/
artifacts/visual-review/
artifacts/*-live.png
tools/artifacts/

# OS metadata and temporary files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
*.tmp
*.temp
~$*
specs/.me
